OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway shut both ways after
OL,4,Alorry hits pedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorway in Lancashire was closed
OL,7,Fafter a collision between a lorry and a
OL,8,Fpedestrian.
OL,10,FThe M55, which connects Blackpool and
OL,11,FPreston, was shut in both directions as
OL,12,Fbetween junction 1 and junction 2 near
OL,13,FPreston, Lancashire Constabulary said.
OL,15,FEmergency services were called at 07:55
OL,16,FGMT to the Broughton area of the
OL,17,Fmotorway.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
