OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway shut both ways after
OL,4,Alorry hits pedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motorway has since reopened. Police
OL,7,Fhave released any further details about
OL,8,Fthe collision. The force has urged
OL,9,Fanyone who saw the incident to come
OL,10,Fforward.
